g\\\"],\\\"brand\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Brand\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"COSORI\\\"},\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"price\\\":378,\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/4qdlj0C\\\",\\\"priceValidUntil\\\":\\\"2027-02-04\\\",\\\"seller\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\"}},\\\"aggregateRating\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"AggregateRating\\\",\\\"ratingValue\\\":4.6,\\\"reviewCount\\\":21158,\\\"bestRating\\\":5,\\\"worstRating\\\":1}}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":5,\\\"item\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Product\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Philips Dual Basket AirFryer 3000 Series (9L)\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/philips-dual-basket-air-fryer-3000\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Perfect for families who want to cook a main (chicken) and a side (veggies) at the same time. The \\\\\\\"Time Sync\\\\\\\" ensures both finish hot at the exact same moment.\\\",\\\"image\\\":[\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/715b2e47173038f9835730b8e73731fcdd5d3c20-948x678.jpg\\\"],\\\"brand\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Brand\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Philips\\\"},\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"price\\\":470,\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/48ODWlB\\\",\\\"priceValidUntil\\\":\\\"2027-02-04\\\",\\\"seller\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\"}},\\\"aggregateRating\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"AggregateRating\\\",\\\"ratingValue\\\":4.6,\\\"reviewCount\\\":514,\\\"bestRating\\\":5,\\\"worstRating\\\":1}}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":6,\\\"item\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Product\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"KENWOOD Air Fryer + Grill XL (4.5L)\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/kenwood-air-fryer-grill-xl\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A no-nonsense workhorse. It doesn't have digital screens or fancy apps, but it cooks well, is very affordable, and comes from a trusted brand unlike generic cheap options.\\\",\\\"image\\\":[\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/d9cd0c841370ede192352cef4ef1547973aa012c-1192x1500.jpg\\\"],\\\"brand\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Brand\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"KENWOOD\\\"},\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"price\\\":149,\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/3KHG99p\\\",\\\"priceValidUntil\\\":\\\"2027-02-04\\\",\\\"seller\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\"}},\\\"aggregateRating\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"AggregateRating\\\",\\\"ratingValue\\\":4.4,\\\"reviewCount\\\":553,\\\"bestRating\\\":5,\\\"worstRating\\\":1}}}]},{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do air fryers really save on DEWA electricity bills?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. An electric oven typically uses 2000-3000W and takes 15 minutes just to preheat. An air fryer like the Nutricook Slim (1700W) or Kenwood (1300W) heats up instantly and cooks 50% faster, significantly reducing your daily kilowatt usage.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which size do I need for a family of 4?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"For a family of 4, avoid anything under 5 Liters. Ideal: 7L+ models like the Nutricook (7.6L) or Philips Dual (9L). Minimum: The Black+Decker (5.6L) or Ninja Max (5.2L) are passable for a family of 4, but you may need to cook sides separately.\\\\\\\" Avoid: The Kenwood (4.5L) is too small for a full family meal.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which brand has the best air fryer in the UAE?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"In 2026, Nutricook and Ninja are the top-rated brands. Nutricook is the #1 choice for value and design (especially for apartments), while Ninja is the highest-rated for cooking speed and crispiness (best for frozen foods). Philips remains a strong premium choice for durability.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the most highly recommended air fryer for families?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"For families of 4 or more, the Nutricook Air Fryer Slim XL (7.6L) and the Philips Dual Basket 3000 (9L) are the most recommended. Both offer enough capacity to cook a whole chicken and side dishes simultaneously, which smaller 4L models cannot do.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How much is the price of an air fryer in Dubai?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Air fryer prices in the UAE vary by features. Budget models like Black+Decker and Kenwood typically range from AED 180 – AED 250. Mid-range models like Nutricook typically cost AED 350 – AED 450, Premium dual-basket models from Ninja or Philips can range from AED 550 to AED 900.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the no. 1 air fryer to buy in 2026?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"If you want the best all-around performer, the Nutricook Air Fryer Slim XL is widely considered the #1 choice for 2026. Its unique slim design saves counter space without sacrificing capacity, solving the biggest complaint users have about bulky kitchen appliances.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the 20/20 rule for air fryers?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The \\\\\\\"20/20 rule\\\\\\\" is a popular cleaning hack: if you have stubborn, burnt-on grease, fill the basket with hot soapy water and let it soak for 20 minutes. Then, rinse and run the air fryer empty at 200°C for 20 minutes (if needed) to burn off any residue or smell.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How do I clean the air fryer heating element (inside top)?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"To clean the top coil without taking the machine apart: 1. Unplug the device and let it cool completely. 2. Turn the air fryer upside down. 3. Use a damp cloth or a soft baking brush to gently wipe away grease splatters from the heating coil. Do this once a month to prevent smoke.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How should I clean my air fryer before the first use?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"New air fryers often have a \\\\\\\"factory plastic\\\\\\\" smell. Before cooking, wash the basket with warm, soapy water. Then, run the air fryer empty at 200°C for 15 to 20 minutes. For best results, place half a lemon inside the basket during this run to neutralize odors instantly.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Are air fryers easy to maintain?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes, compared to traditional ovens, they are very easy. Most baskets (like Nutricook and Philips) are dishwasher safe. However, budget models with metal interiors (like Black+Decker) must be hand-washed and dried immediately to prevent rust.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How do I clean a Philips or Ninja air fryer specifically?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"For Philips, the \\\\\\\"QuickClean\\\\\\\" basket is dishwasher safe, but the top element should be wiped manually. For Ninja, the ceramic-coated basket is durable, but you should avoid harsh scouring pads (metal sponges) as they will strip the non-stick coating. Always use a soft sponge.\\\"}}]}]}\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"20:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySet