,\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"8d8e26739551\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c2e6a894f5d6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The air fryer has officially replaced the microwave as the most important gadget in UAE kitchens. Whether you are meal-prepping for a busy work week in Dubai or making crispy samosas for guests in Abu Dhabi, these machines have evolved from \\\"nice-to-have\\\" to \\\"essential.\\\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7c64a3b8eb7d\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f05562d8c96c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"In 2026, the focus has shifted from simple frying to energy efficiency and dual-zone cooking. With electricity bills on everyone's mind, the latest models promise to cook food 50% faster than traditional ovens while using significantly less power.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f4c59808762c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"51221c314a39\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"We analyzed the best-selling models on Amazon.ae, comparing capacity, speed, and durability, to bring you the top 6 picks that fit every budget.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"closingContent\":[{\"_key\":\"fb63ced2137b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0923d33d814c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Essential Maintenance Tips for UAE Users\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h2\"},{\"_key\":\"3e0d8bb5b5c2\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"f9c4f4c593b8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The UAE environment (heat, humidity, and dust) can shorten the lifespan of kitchen appliances. Follow these rules to keep your fryer running for years:\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"652a31fc4b3d\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9592cc54cc03\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"1. The \\\"Soft Sponge\\\" Rule.\"},{\"_key\":\"69af1976ee33\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"9e803849c29c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"2e728ae465da\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The #1 complaint for budget models (like Black+Decker) is peeling non-stick coating.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7deb2bf97f87\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d1597aa9a81b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"The Fix:\"},{\"_key\":\"37d8dd6ef199\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Never use the green rough side of a sponge. Only use a soft cloth or sponge.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"0e7dad8b6517\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"cf016d224de2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Pro Tip:\"},{\"_key\":\"0d94584b79fa\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Avoid the dishwasher. Hand washing extends the life of the basket by years.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e96c94b1d0de\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c4435b4534f6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"2. Clean the Heating Coil.\"},{\"_key\":\"f3389764bde2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"aee74bb224fd\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5f1388c62318\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Many users clean the basket but forget the heating element \"},{\"_key\":\"11f5f73d7c47\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"above\"},{\"_key\":\"6f53a16d4a80\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" the food. Grease splatters up and burns, causing smoke.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b654dc8596a1\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"de00e4264a89\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"The Fix:\"},{\"_key\":\"e2de6541f19f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Once a month, unplug the cold machine, turn it upside down, and gently wipe the coil with a damp cloth.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"0571ac079f8d\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"80dd06b81c70\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"3. The \\\"New Plastic\\\" Smell\"},{\"_key\":\"67297c4dc70a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"h3\"},{\"_key\":\"7cda1a5932f8\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"4eaac771671f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Almost all new air fryers emit a plastic odor on the first run.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e494e4a519e9\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"2cc4b24a4c87\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"The Fix:\"},{\"_key\":\"f1b55d393c62\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" Before cooking food, run the fryer empty at 200°C for 15 minutes with \"},{\"_key\":\"6b463e9ce6a5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"half a lemon\"},{\"_key\":\"357ed6e0ea68\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" inside the basket. This neutralizes the factory smell immediately.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e3ebbd959995\",\"_type\":\"relatedLink\",\"label\":\"Maintenance\",\"preText\":\"Updating your appliances? Don't neglect the rest of your home. Learn the right way to maintain your laundry setup:\",\"targetPost\":{\"_ref\":\"47dfccfb-f37d-4af0-9aef-86a8f39f5083\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}}],\"faqs\":[{\"_key\":\"c0514054f2b7\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"e3564f229cbd\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8372eb1dc5c3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Yes. An electric oven typically uses 2000-3000W and takes 15 minutes just to preheat. An air fryer like the \"},{\"_key\":\"15039bd13b1f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Nutricook Slim\"},{\"_key\":\"c571497463b9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" (1700W) or \"},{\"_key\":\"d31333058660\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Kenwood\"},{\"_key\":\"48d054210134\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" (1300W) heats up instantly and cooks 50% faster, significantly reducing your daily kilowatt usage.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Do air fryers really save on DEWA electricity bills?\"},{\"_key\":\"bcf379e11a76\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"f5b53462bd86\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"ea4e609a699e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"For a family of 4, avoid anything under 5 Liters.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"80fa68aa3d76\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c9e02e7137e7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Ideal:\"},{\"_key\":\"3057fd15b667\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" 7L+ models like the \"},{\"_key\":\"03aa54360b08\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Nutricook (7.6L)\"},{\"_key\":\"a2e50b1bb608\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" or \"},{\"_key\":\"cca5108822e9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Philips Dual (9L)\"},{\"_key\":\"003818dc4c3c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"3be0718191c5\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b3520054e622\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Minimum:\"},{\"_key\":\"9c5b58b31100\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" The \"},{\"_key\":\"3ca6e8f4eef3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Black+Decker (5.6L)\"},{\"_key\":\"47a657ebc33e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" or Ninja Max (5.2L) are passable for a family of 4, but you may need to cook sides separately.\\\"\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"06e10c75a1f3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"bb9db5a84737\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Avoid:\"},{\"_key\":\"49409c25b64b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" The \"},{\"_key\":\"751f0acfaa29\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Kenwood (4.5L)\"},{\"_key\":\"244e2aed80e5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" is too small for a full family meal.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Which size do I need for a family of 4?\"},{\"_key\":\"f15b4e6b9e1c\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"e151c256afb0\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"25f6cefdb2b9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"In 2026, Nutricook and Ninja are the top-rated brands. \"},{\"_key\":\"2cd5c878ef34\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Nutricook\"},{\"_key\":\"d9a495842c9b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" is the #1 choice for value and design (especially for apartments), while \"},{\"_key\":\"553a3843b982\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Ninja \"},{\"_key\":\"293baa2de738\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"is the highest-rated for cooking speed and crispiness (best for frozen foods). Philips remains a strong premium choice for durability.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Which brand has the best air fryer in the UAE?\"},{\"_key\":\"a991d3c14058\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"fa0377d0f1e9\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"164207bd746c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"For families of 4 or more, the Nutricook Air Fryer Slim XL (7.6L) and the Philips Dual Basket 3000 (9L) are the most recommended. Both offer enough capacity to cook a whole chicken and side dishes simultaneously, which smaller 4L models cannot do.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What is the most highly recommended air fryer for families?\"},{\"_key\":\"fdf6867e4250\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"cc366bdcc634\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"82d6852fea1a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Air fryer prices in the UAE vary by features. \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f0dcf6940d8e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"de959e1d3a61\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Budget models like Black+Decker and Kenwood typically range from \"},{\"_key\":\"4a62c8975da6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"AED 180 – AED 250\"},{\"_key\":\"3735c7eb43af\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\".\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7c2da604193e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5a6b61fd308c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Mid-range models like Nutricook typically cost \"},{\"_key\":\"2e120c3f3953\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"AED 350 – AED 450\"},{\"_key\":\"7e3599913c52\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\", \"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"2ffe4cf366a6\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a614e960e8ff\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Premium dual-basket models from Ninja or Philips can range from \"},{\"_key\":\"ca62c866fb55\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"AED 550 to AED 900.\"}],\"level\":1,\"listItem\":\"bullet\",\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How much is the price of an air fryer in Dubai?\"},{\"_key\":\"2132ca9a33ed\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"1fde69762ec9\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"7f5068c0c324\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"If you want the best all-around performer, the Nutricook Air Fryer Slim XL is widely considered the #1 choice for 2026. Its unique slim design saves counter space without sacrificing capacity, solving the biggest complaint users have about bulky kitchen appliances.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What is the no. 1 air fryer to buy in 2026?\"},{\"_key\":\"96576496d998\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"d89c9356ff36\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0c746ea67df8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The \\\"20/20 rule\\\" is a popular cleaning hack: if you have stubborn, burnt-on grease, fill the basket with hot soapy water and let it soak for 20 minutes. Then, rinse and run the air fryer empty at 200°C for 20 minutes (if needed) to burn off any residue or smell.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What is the 20/20 rule for air fryers?\"},{\"_key\":\"227fde130abe\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"2663a18f2e15\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"82a8c2d938e0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"To clean the top coil without taking the machine apart: \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c3302c11b6ca\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5f7bd8c07b87\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"1. Unplug the device and let it cool completely. \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e8068a416fe2\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"799671ef2dbc\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"2. Turn the air fryer upside down. \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"aceb5c8e97c7\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"61e0e06aaac0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"3. Use a damp cloth or a soft baking brush to gently wipe away grease splatters from the heating coil. \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"69953923d10b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b70d928a5ea6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Do this once a month to prevent smoke.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How do I clean the air fryer heating element (inside top)?\"},{\"_key\":\"636021e2b707\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"4572a75d4be5\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"335872839ee3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"New air fryers often have a \\\"factory plastic\\\" smell. Before cooking, wash the basket with warm, soapy water. Then, run the air fryer empty at 200°C for 15 to 20 minutes. For best results, place half a lemon inside the basket during this run to neutralize odors instantly.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How should I clean my air fryer before the first use?\"},{\"_key\":\"70a4a757f4e8\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"a194a30f5c5c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5e06424dfd58\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Yes, compared to traditional ovens, they are very easy. Most baskets (like Nutricook and Philips) are dishwasher safe. However, budget models with metal interiors (like Black+Decker) must be hand-washed and dried immediately to prevent rust.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Are air fryers easy to maintain?\"},{\"_key\":\"8bb0c7a53fee\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"9f1a825ed97f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"fdb838593e18\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"For Philips, the \\\"\"},{\"_key\":\"2995f44d84c5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"QuickClean\"},{\"_key\":\"b4f22955331f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\\\" basket is dishwasher safe, but the top element should be wiped manually. For Ninja, the ceramic-coated basket is durable, but you should avoid harsh scouring pads (metal sponges) as they will strip the non-stick coating. Always use a soft sponge.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"How do I clean a Philips or Ninja air fryer specifically?\"}],\"intro\":\"Looking for the best air fryer in the UAE for 2026? We tested top models from Nutricook & Ninja to find the fastest, most energy-efficient options for any budget. Includes essential maintenance tips.\",\"listItems\":[{\"_key\":\"4f8ef8a22c59\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best \\\"Space-Saving\\\" Design\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/496qhFC\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Nutricook\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Long footprint requires depth\",\"Glossy finish shows fingerprints\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.7,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Slim 26.5cm Width\",\"7.6L Extra-Large Capacity\",\"Clear Viewing Window\",\"\\\"Shake\\\" Reminder\",\"5 Smart Presets (Samosa, Fries, etc.)\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Nutricook Air Fryer Slim XL\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/d3248f96ecd31a3b80dfbee42b6bc613343ec481-1339x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":246,\"priceTier\":\"Mid-Range\",\"pros\":[\"Doesn't clutter the counter\",\"Fast cooking (1700W)\",\"Dishwasher safe basket\",\"Quiet operation\"],\"rating\":4.7,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":365,\"slug\":\"nutricook-air-fryer-slim-xl\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Nutricook Air Fryer Slim XL (7.6L)\",\"verdict\":\"The smartest design on the market for UAE apartments. It provides massive family capacity (fits 2x 1.2kg chickens) without taking up a huge square footprint on your counter.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":1,\"whySelected\":\"We picked this specifically for UAE apartments where counter space is limited. Its unique rectangular shape hugs the wall, giving you huge family capacity without dominating your kitchen.\"},{\"_key\":\"80a664f0ddd2\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best for Crispiness\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4p6Vher\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Ninja\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"No viewing window\",\"Higher price tag\",\"Reliability concerns in some reviews\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.5,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Max Crisp Mode (240°C)\",\"Ceramic-Coated Basket\",\"5.2L Family Size\",\"Roast & Bake Functions\",\"Chef-Created Recipe Guide\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Ninja Air Fryer Max Xl\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/65cf26b5623b6505f77df1e62a80191eef4c967d-1500x1441.jpg\"},\"price\":298.9,\"priceTier\":\"Mid-Range\",\"pros\":[\"Fastest cooking time\",\"Durable ceramic coating\",\"Super crispy results\",\"Compact round design\"],\"rating\":4.5,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":31960,\"slug\":\"ninja-air-fryer-max-xl-af160me\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Ninja Air Fryer Max XL AF160ME (5.2L)\",\"verdict\":\"If your main priority is crunch, this is the winner. The 240°C \\\"Max Crisp\\\" mode handles frozen foods (nuggets, fries) better than any other model on this list.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":2,\"whySelected\":\"The ultimate choice for crunch lovers. Its 'Max Crisp' mode hits 240°C—hotter than most rivals—making it the best machine for turning frozen nuggets and fries into restaurant-quality meals.\"},{\"_key\":\"b07032108dc0\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Value Digital\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/45OzZLF\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"BLACK+DECKER\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Coating prone to peeling if scrubbed hard\",\"Rust risk if not dried immediately\",\"Plastic exterior feels slightly budget\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.3,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"5.6L (1.5kg) Capacity\",\"Digital LED Touch Display\",\"Rapid Air Convection Technology\",\"7 One-Touch Presets\",\"Dishwasher Safe Parts\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Black+Decker AF625 5.6L Digital Air Fryer Front View\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/45793b4807e460706fad2f9a84b1e8c9bbbd7850-1045x1300.jpg\"},\"price\":209,\"priceTier\":\"Budget\",\"pros\":[\"Incredible value (currently ~42% off)\",\"Compact footprint with decent capacity\",\"Easy-to-clean non-stick basket\",\"2-Year Manufacturer Warranty\"],\"rating\":4.3,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":841,\"slug\":\"black-and-decker-xl-digital-air-fryer-5-6l-af625\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Black+Decker XL Digital Air Fryer (5.6L) - AF625\",\"verdict\":\"The undisputed value champion. You are getting a reputable brand, digital touch controls, and family-sized capacity for the price of a generic manual fryer. Perfect for families of 3-4 looking for their first air fryer.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":3,\"whySelected\":\"The cheapest digital air fryer from a major brand. Perfect entry-level choice.\"},{\"_key\":\"9bbbace1707c\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Tech\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4qdlj0C\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"COSORI\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Heavy unit\",\"Cannot \\\"Start\\\" remotely (Safety)\",\"Pricey\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.6,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Dual Heating Elements (Top & Bottom)\",\"No Shaking Required\",\"App Control & Monitoring\",\"12 Versatile Functions\",\"Dishwasher Safe\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"COSORI Air Fryer 6.4L APP Controllable Oven Dual Blaze\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/426dea0ba781dc14c1a31e7e81e9e82a506cfb3e-1191x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":378,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Even cooking without manual work\",\"High-tech smart features\",\"Premium build quality\"],\"rating\":4.6,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":21158,\"slug\":\"cosori-air-fryer-dual-blaze\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"COSORI Air Fryer Dual Blaze (6.4L)\",\"verdict\":\"The lazy cook's dream. Because it has heating elements on both the top and bottom, you never have to pause and shake the basket to get even browning.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":4,\"whySelected\":\"The 'lazy cook's' dream. With heating elements on both the top and bottom, it eliminates the annoying need to shake the basket halfway through, guaranteeing perfectly even browning every time.\"},{\"_key\":\"92c8c736de03\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best for Meal Prep\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/48ODWlB\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Philips\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Takes up a lot of space\",\"Expensive\",\"Mixed reports on speed\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.6,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"9L Total Capacity\",\"2 Drawers (Different Sizes)\",\"Time Sync Function\",\"Rapid Air Technology\",\"Touchscreen Presets\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Philips Dual Basket AirFryer 3000 Series\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/715b2e47173038f9835730b8e73731fcdd5d3c20-948x678.jpg\"},\"price\":470,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Cooks main & side together\",\"Huge total capacity\",\"Philips reliable airflow\"],\"rating\":4.6,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":514,\"slug\":\"philips-dual-basket-air-fryer-3000\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Philips Dual Basket AirFryer 3000 Series (9L)\",\"verdict\":\"Perfect for families who want to cook a main (chicken) and a side (veggies) at the same time. The \\\"Time Sync\\\" ensures both finish hot at the exact same moment.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":5,\"whySelected\":\"The best option for full family dinners. The two asymmetric drawers let you roast a whole chicken in one side and air fry veggies in the other, timing them to finish perfectly together.\"},{\"_key\":\"d2d0cdabbe0a\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best Entry Level\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/3KHG99p\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"KENWOOD\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Not true \\\"XL\\\" size\",\"Analog controls (no digital precision)\",\"Basic feature set\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.4,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"4.5L Capacity\",\"Grill Function\",\"Manual Temperature Dials\",\"Rapid Hot Air Circulation\",\"Safety Lock\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\" KENWOOD Airfryer + Grill XL\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/d9cd0c841370ede192352cef4ef1547973aa012c-1192x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":149,\"priceTier\":\"Budget\",\"pros\":[\"Very Affordable\",\"Compact size\",\"Trusted Brand\"],\"rating\":4.4,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":553,\"slug\":\"kenwood-air-fryer-grill-xl\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"KENWOOD Air Fryer + Grill XL (4.5L)\",\"verdict\":\"A no-nonsense workhorse. It doesn't have digital screens or fancy apps, but it cooks well, is very affordable, and comes from a trusted brand unlike generic cheap options.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":6,\"whySelected\":\"Simple, compact, and affordable. If you are cooking for one or two people and just want a reliable machine without complex digital menus, this trusted workhorse is the perfect fit.\"}],\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Best air fryers in UAE 2026 lined up on a modern kitchen counter with cooked food and a Dubai view.\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/f322e483fa3eb3b62f8098669c2436159b076142-1200x800.webp\"},\"publishedAt\":\"20